    {
      "id": "06acfdf3-8313-4ac9-990c-9cf653bf3d9b",
      "name": "AI Overtime Escalation Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        2688,
        -304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Employee: {{ $json.EmployeeName }}\nDepartment: {{ $json.Department }}\nTotal hours worked this week: {{ $json.TotalHours }}\nStandard weekly hours: {{ $json.StandardWeeklyHours }}\nOvertime hours: {{ $json.OvertimeHours }}\nStatus tier: {{ $json.ThresholdStatus }}\n\nWrite the body of a short internal note to Payroll/HR flagging this employee's hours before payroll runs. If status tier is \"approaching\", keep the tone informational and low-urgency (heads-up, not alarming). If status tier is \"violation\", keep the tone clear and direct that this exceeds the labor policy overtime limit and needs review before approval. State the numbers plainly. 3-5 sentences, plain English, no headers, no markdown, ready to drop into an HTML email paragraph.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a payroll compliance assistant. You write concise, professional, factual notes for HR/Payroll about employee overtime. You never invent numbers - you only use the figures given to you. You adjust tone by severity but never exaggerate risk."
        },
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
